{"id": 21141, "title": "My Bicycle", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-bicycle", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/21141_my-bicycle.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我最喜欢的车是自行车。 我六岁的时候， 妈妈就给我买了一辆小自行车。 那辆车非常漂亮， 像天空一样蓝。 虽然车很小， 但是我可以骑得很快。", "我经常骑着我的自行车去公园或者图书馆， 经过街道和大桥， 穿过整个城市。 自行车就是我最好的朋友。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我最喜歡的車是自行車。 我六歲的時候， 媽媽就給我買了一輛小自行車。 那輛車非常漂亮， 像天空一樣藍。 雖然車很小， 但是我可以騎得很快。", "我經常騎著我的自行車去公園或者圖書館， 經過街道和大橋， 穿過整個城市。 自行車就是我最好的朋友。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ zuì xǐ huan de chē shì zì xíng chē。  wǒ liù suì de shí hou，  mā ma jiù gěi wǒ mǎi le yī liàng xiǎo zì xíng chē。  nà liàng chē fēi cháng piào liang，  xiàng tiān kōng yī yàng lán。  suī rán chē hěn xiǎo，  dàn shì wǒ kě yǐ qí de hěn kuài。", "wǒ jīng cháng qí zhe wǒ de zì xíng chē qù gōng yuán huò zhě tú shū guǎn，  jīng guò jiē dào hé dà qiáo，  chuān guò zhěng gè chéng shì。  zì xíng chē jiù shì wǒ zuì hǎo de péng you。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My favorite car is a bicycle. When I was six years old, my mother bought me a small bicycle. That car is very beautiful, as blue as the sky. Although the car is small, I can ride it very fast.", "I often ride my bike to the park or library, through streets and bridges, and across the city. Bikes are my best friends."], "english_full": "My favorite car is a bicycle. When I was six years old, my mother bought me a small bicycle. That car is very beautiful, as blue as the sky. Although the car is small, I can ride it very fast.\n\nI often ride my bike to the park or library, through streets and bridges, and across the city. Bikes are my best friends.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì\" data-defn=\"(before an adjective or verb) to the highest degree; (the) most ...; -est\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby><ruby cla